threshold diversity.\n\\newblock \\emph{arXiv preprint}.\n\n\\bibitem[\\protect\\citename{PIE}2024]{pie2024}\nIterative pruning ensemble for circuit discovery.\n\\newblock 2024.\n\\newblock \\emph{arXiv preprint arXiv:2604.16889}.\n\n\\bibitem[\\protect\\citename{Syed et al.}2023]{syed2023attribution}\nAaquib Syed, Can Rager, and Arthur Conmy.\n\\newblock 2023.\n\\newblock Attribution patching outperforms automated circuit discovery.\n\\newblock \\emph{arXiv preprint arXiv:2310.10348}.\n\n\\bibitem[\\protect\\citename{Wang et al.}2023]{wang2023interpretability}\nKevin Wang, Alexandre Variengien, Arthur Conmy, Buck Shlegeris, and Jacob Steinhardt.\n\\newblock 2023.\n\\newblock Interpretability in the wild: a circuit for indirect object identification in GPT-2 small.\n\\newblock In \\emph{International Conference on Learning Representations}.\n\n\\end{thebibliography}","new_string":"\\begin{thebibliography}{10}\n\n\\bibitem[{Conmy et~al.(2023)}]{conmy2023towards}\nA.~Conmy, A.~N.~Mavor-Parker, A.~Lynch, S.~Heimersheim, and A.~Garriga-Alonso.\nTowards automated circuit discovery for mechanistic interpretability.\nIn \\emph{NeurIPS}, 2023.\n\n\\bibitem[{Elhage et~al.(2021)}]{elhage2021mathematical}\nN.~Elhage, N.~Nanda, C.~Olsson, et~al.\nA mathematical framework for transformer circuits.\n\\emph{Transformer Circuits Thread}, 2021.\n\n\\bibitem[{Li et~al.(2024)}]{li2024circuit}\nX.~Li, Q.~Zeng, H.~Chen, and X.~Xie.\nCircuit discovery via edge pruning.\n\\emph{arXiv:2406.xxxxx}, 2024.\n\n\\bibitem[{Mondorf et~al.(2025)}]{mondorf2025crossmethod}\nP.~Mondorf, J.~Liem, and B.~Plank.\nCross-method agreement in circuit discovery.\n\\emph{arXiv:2510.06811}, 2025.\n\n\\bibitem[{Parekh et~al.(2026)}]{parekh2026circus}\nJ.~N.~Parekh et~al.\nCIRCUS: Circuit robustness under threshold diversity.\n\\emph{arXiv preprint}, 2026.\n\n\\bibitem[{PIE(2024)}]{pie2024}\nIterative pruning ensemble for circuit discovery.\n\\emph{arXiv:2604.16889}, 2024.\n\n\\bibitem[{Syed et~al.(2023)}]{syed2023attribution}\nA.~Syed, C.~Rager, and A.~Conmy.\nAttribution patching outperforms automated circuit discovery.\n\\emph{arXiv:2310.10348}, 2023.\n\n\\bibitem[{Wang et~al.(2023)}]{wang2023interpretability}\nK.~Wang, A.~Variengien, A.~Conmy, B.~Shlegeris, and J.~Steinhardt.\nInterpretability in the wild: A circuit for indirect object identification in GPT-2 small.\nIn \\emph{ICLR}, 2023.\n\n\\end{thebibliography}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":257,"cache_read_input_tokens":53251,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":257},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d3b5a1b-37a4-430d-9366-21202b90c047","uuid":"4746a7ae-8e73-4f4c-a8f6-63ad07cedd74"}
